{
  "$comment": "The one source of the plugin view limits (docs/plugin-api.md 1.6, docs/SPEC.md 7k Notices). droidtop's PluginViewLimits, plugin-common-py's gg.lint_view and the Kotlin PluginViewLint read this file; nothing restates a number. Over a length the host cuts with an ellipsis, over a count it drops, and either is logged as a plugin message.",
